# Ribbon from the tri-anthracene precursor (picture a). The tip state sits in the middle of
# the outer anthracene edge (symmetric), so it couples directly to its own backbone site.
site Tu near  3.689   1.42     # middle of the top anthracene edge
site Td near 12.298 -16.33     # middle of the bottom anthracene edge
site Bu near  3.689  -9.94     # backbone under the up-protrusion
site Bd near 12.298  -4.97     # backbone above the down-protrusion
onsite Tu eT
onsite Td eT
onsite Bu eB
onsite Bd eB
hop Bu Bd 0 tB
hop Bd Bu 1 tB
hop Tu Bu 0 tau
hop Td Bd 0 tau
hop Tu Td 0 tT
hop Td Tu 1 tT
